  m_Name: Kalaw_0_part2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: KALAW
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Feel that faint hum?

    The Ilocos Language Crystal inside it
    is sleeping.

    To charge it up and awaken its power, you''ve got to explore
    Calle Crisologo and speak with the locals in their native tongue.

    As you
    practice and learn how Ilocanos talk in their daily lives, your voice will help
    restore the crystal''s power.

    So, let''s begin with something simple.

    Before
    you can truly connect with the people of Ilocos, you must first learn how to
    greet them."

'
